TIGHTER DRAWERS
- The filter cutoff now starts with its knob at 12 o'clock (about 894 Hz), and you can double-tap it to reset
- The Modulation, Delay, Tune and ARP/SEQ drawers are shorter, so they fit on a phone in landscape
- Delay: Reset now sits in the title bar, and the labels are next to their controls
- Modulation: the on/off switch is in the title bar, and Depth is next to Rate and Random
- Tune: the −/+ cent buttons are on either side of the knob
